<human_speech><green>This adversary is a drillmaster. It rotates its ships around its subs, masses them when attacked, and attacks only when it is sure.<\green><blue>Sure how? It counts. Its strike needs three times whatever it is aiming at. You can see the muster coming if you look.<\blue><green>The rotation dodges attrition, so its column keeps growing. Waiting favours it. Do not wait.<\green><blue>Use <\blue><shining>ToolCall:Note<\shining><blue> on anything it does twice.<\blue><\human_speech>
